mmary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I'm having a little doubt regarding the latest 3.2.0 linux-arm64 release.\n\nI installed it on a 18.04 (sigh!) VOXL2 SBC, because I was absolutely not able to compile it there...\n\nHowever the mavsdk-server starts, but even though it claims to be listening on 50051 for gRPC I cannot connect and traces indicate that it is not listening at all there.\n\n```\nvoxl2-mini:~$ ./mavsdk_server -h\nUsage: ./mavsdk_server [Options] [Connection URL]\n\nConnection URL format should be:\n  Serial: serial:///path/to/serial/dev[:baudrate]\n  UDP:    udp://[bind_host][:bind_port]\n  TCP:    tcp://[server_host][:server_port]\n\nFor example to connect to SITL use: udp://:14540\n\nOptions:\n  -h | --help : show this help\n  -p          : set the port on which to run the gRPC server,\n                set to 0 to choose a free port automatically\n                (default is 50051)\n  --sysid     : set the MAVLink system ID of the MAVSDK server itself,\n                (default is 245, range 1..255)\n  --compid    : set the MAVLink component ID of the MAVSDK server itself,\n                (default is 190, range 1..255)\n````\n\nNote: -p\n\nI can neighther reach the server from GO nor see it listening (anonymized some IPs):\n\n```\nvoxl2-mini:~$ ss -ltnp\nState     Recv-Q     Send-Q                        Local Address:Port           Peer Address:Port                                                     \nLISTEN    0          128                           100.x.x.x:40259               0.0.0.0:*         users:((\"tailscaled\",pid=1272,fd=21))          \nLISTEN    0          5                                   0.0.0.0:8900                0.0.0.0:*         users:((\"voxl-streamer\",pid=2553,fd=4))        \nLISTEN    0          4                                 127.0.0.1:5037                0.0.0.0:*         users:((\"adbd\",pid=1763,fd=5))                 \nLISTEN    0          128                                 0.0.0.0:80                  0.0.0.0:*         users:((\"voxl-portal\",pid=1608,fd=3))          \nLISTEN    0          128                           127.0.0.53%lo:53                  0.0.0.0:*         users:((\"systemd-resolve\",pid=1178,fd=13))     \nLISTEN    0          128                                 0.0.0.0:22                  0.0.0.0:*         users:((\"sshd\",pid=1575,fd=3))                 \nLISTEN    0          128             [fd7a:x.x.x.x.x.]:63461                  [::]:*         users:((\"tailscaled\",pid=1272,fd=22))          \nLISTEN    0          128                                    [::]:22                     [::]:*         users:((\"sshd\",pid=1575,fd=4))                 \n```\n\nWhat am I doing wrong?\n\nEDIT: I double checked with a source build of mavsdk_server on Ubuntu 22.04 AMD64:\n\nThere it states explicitly that it is listening on 50051:\n\n\"Server set to listen on 0.0.0.0:50051\"\n\nThis trace is not coming here on ARM\n", "closed_by": {"login": "neilyoung", "id": 731020, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjczMTAyMA==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/731020?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/neilyoung", "html_url": "https://github.com/neilyoung", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/neilyoung/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/neilyoung/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/neilyoung/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/neilyoung/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/neilyoung/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/neilyoung/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/neilyoung/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/neilyoung/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/neilyoung/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": 